<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="brand">CampusHub 校园圈</view><view class="subtitle">闲置找到新主人，校园遇见新伙伴</view></view><picker class="school" range="{{schools}}" value="{{schoolIndex}}" bindchange="changeSchool"><view>学校 · {{school}} ▾</view></picker><view class="search" bindtap="search">搜索二手商品 →</view><view class="notice">MVP V0.1 · 三所学校均为虚构，所有信息仅供演示。</view><view class="row"><view class="section">二手好物</view><text class="pill" bindtap="market">查看全部 →</text></view><view class="grid"><view class="card" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct"><view class="placeholder">{{item.badge}}</view><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="price">¥ {{item.price}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.school}} · {{item.category}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!products.length}}" class="empty">本校暂无商品，发布第一件好物吧</view><button class="primary" bindtap="publish">发布闲置</button><view class="row"><view class="section">最新需求</view><text class="pill" bindtap="needs">更多 →</text></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{needs}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openNeed"><view class="pill">{{item.category}}</view><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.school}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!needs.length}}" class="empty">本校暂无需求</view></view>
